# Machine-local cache of the last-known Tor onion address, written by
# 'bitstack up'/'bitstack tor', consumed by 'bitstack wallet'.
/.bitstack-onion

# Per-machine agentstack identity (CANONICAL_LOCAL_REPO is only correct on the
# machine that wrote it). Created in the working tree by add-to-project.sh /
# each agent worktree; never committed. See .agentstack/docs/submodule-integration.md.
/.agentstack.env
